  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n**(First term + Third term) ÷ 2 = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(34, 23, 12)\n\n(__**34** + 12__) ÷ 2 = 23\n\n__46 ÷ 2__ = 23\n\n23 = 23\n\n(71, 37, 3)\n\n(__**71 + 3**__) ÷ 2 = 37\n\n__**74 ÷ 2**__ = 37\n\n37 = 37 \n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (75, 50, 20)\n\n(__75 + 20__) ÷ 2 = 50\n\n__95 ÷ 2__ = 50\n\n47.5 ≠ 50\n\nOption 2) (20, 65, 50)\n\n(__20 + 50__) ÷ 2 = 65\n\n__70 ÷ 2__ = 65\n\n35 ≠ 65\n\nOption 3) (19, 55, 91)\n\n(__19 + 91__) ÷ 2 = 55\n\n__110 ÷ 2__ = 55\n\n**55 = 55**\n\nOption 4) (14, 12, 16)\n\n(__14 + 16__) ÷ 2 = 12\n\n__30 ÷ 2__ = 12\n\n15 ≠ 12\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
